{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"一个人几次想表达喜欢又忍住，这次终于藏不住在意；面对对方的亲近，自己却开始失落和不知所措。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"空落、在意、无措、怕被嫌太黏\",\n      \"missed\": \"右上角三阶段提示“心动却不敢说、靠近了又舍不得、心意露出来又怕被嫌”需要仔细看。中间的小字意象“托举消失、耳语戛然而止、只剩自己、幸福是真的吗、松开紧握的手”也不能一眼全部抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"一个人喜欢的心意被看出来了，原本自然的亲近如今变得有些尴尬，不知道该怎么面对对方。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"空落、忐忑、害怕被嫌弃、局促\",\n      \"missed\": \"“以前能装不在乎”与“如今”的前后变化需要读完整句才能理解；右上角三阶段提示较小，中间关于幸福能维持多久的疑问也容易漏掉。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"一个人没能继续藏住喜欢，虽然对方依然亲近，却开始觉得熟悉的相处有了距离，担心自己表现得太在乎。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"空落、患得患失、怕被嫌黏、孤独\",\n      \"missed\": \"右上角的阶段关系仍然需要逐条看；“托举消失、单薄旋律漂进雾里、耳语戛然而止、只剩自己”等画面感文字不能在第一眼完整接收到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 4,\n  \"main_problem\": \"两条大标题都比较长，各自包含前因、转折和结果。一眼能抓到“喜欢没藏住”“空落落”“怕被嫌太黏”这些核心，但不一定能同时抓住“对方仍亲近”与“熟悉亲近像隔层”之间的微妙关系。右上角三阶段提示虽然能补足人物心理变化，但字号太小，容易被忽略。整体的事情和感受是连贯的，中间的孤独、耳语停止、松开手等意象也基本挂在这段关系变化上，并没有明显散成互不相关的词。主要问题是信息读全需要时间，而不是内容彼此不连贯。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "32853bf2-7104-4e99-b316-c47787795c59", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T224023304221Z", "elapsed_seconds": 79.125, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T22:41:42.418876+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5e783c308cd000c56a8dbe14491c530334cbc0cf03683d73d8676a4c07a53c49", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T224023304221Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "f08246fe27fac19b018123eb3006b2ad5dacea1192e0e69edf1b5d6089fa987a"}}}
